OL,3,GNEWSAStreet's past and present in focus
OL,4,Afor exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA street's past and present is the
OL,7,Ffocus of a photography exhibition as
OL,8,Fthe area shapes up to become part of a
OL,9,Fhub for the screen industry.
OL,11,FDegree students from the Northern
OL,12,FSchool of Art in Hartlepool have been
OL,13,Fdocumenting the town's Church Street.
OL,15,FTheir work is being displayed alongside
OL,16,Fpictures of the street and other parts
OL,17,Fof Teesside taken by artist and
OL,18,Fphotographer Peter Benson from the late
OL,19,F1960s onwards.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
